# Copy to .env and fill in your own key. .env is gitignored — never commit a real key.
#
# Used by the Agent Chat feature's Vite dev-server proxy (vite.config.ts) to
# call the Claude API server-side. Deliberately has NO VITE_ prefix — Vite
# only exposes VITE_-prefixed vars to client code, so this key never reaches
# the browser bundle. Restart `npm run dev` after changing this file.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
